trol fire and ![","target":"https://www.nationalfoodmuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Homo_erectus_cooking_food_over_flames-450x450.png","line":11},{"title":"Invention of cooking drove evolution of the human species, new book argues — Harvard Gazette","target":"https://news.harvard.edu/gazette/story/2009/06/invention-of-cooking-drove-evolution-of-the-human-species-new-book-argues/","line":28},{"title":"Cooking | Techniques, Recipes & Nutrition | Britannica","target":"https://www.britannica.com/topic/cooking","line":30},{"title":"The Evolution of Cooking: A Defining Moment in Human History (anthropology.net)","target":"https://www.anthropology.net/p/the-evolution-of-cooking-a-defining","line":32},{"title":"Bing Videos","target":"https://www.bing.com/videos/search?view=detail&q=what+is+the+importance+of+the+invention+of+cooking%3f&mid=61E57D57EDE2C0B4F9A161E57D57EDE2C0B4F9A1&FORM=VIRE","line":34},{"title":"50 percent of women","target":"https://www.karger.com/Article/Abstract/12770","line":36},{"title":"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/food-for-thought-was-cooking-a-pivotal-step-in-human-evolution/","target":"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/food-for-thought-was-cooking-a-pivotal-step-in-human-evolution/","line":36}],"metadata":{"title":"The 11 Most Impactful Events in Food History","source":"https://www.nationalfoodmuseum.org/the-11-most-impactful-events-in-food-history/","author":null,"published":null,"created":"2025-04-28","description":"The 11 Most Impactful Events in Food History The National Food Museum is interested in all aspects of food—the history of the human diet, the contribution of the food system to the climate crisis, recipes for healthier “plant-forward” cooking, and more. This list of the “most impactful” developments in the food world was compiled by […]","tags":[]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1i5gm4r","at":1778088458004},"key":"Clippings/The 11 Most Impactful Events in Food History.md"},
